        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Central primitive neuroectodermal tumour&nbsp;/ CNS embryonal tumour is a malignant tumour of central-type neuroectodermal derivation.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
