      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63970,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours are more common in the uterine corpus than in the cervix.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63971,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "<p>Presentations include abnormal uterine bleeding, pelvic pain/pressure, and a uterine mass.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-24T16:26:41"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63972,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are rare tumours and occur in women with a median age of 55&nbsp;years (range: 26&ndash;81&nbsp;years) {18223324; 28296680; 12376920}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63973,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63974,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63975,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "<p>These tumours often form a polypoid fleshy mass with haemorrhage {18223324; 28296680; 12376920}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-24T16:26:57"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63976,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "<p>The tumours are characterized by small round blue cells or may display neuronal/glial differentiation. Some are associated with another tumour type, such as carcinoma, adenosarcoma, or carcinosarcoma {18223324; 28296680; 1328031}. Synaptophysin, chromogranin, and S100 are often positive, and GFAP is positive in approximately half of all cases. Membranous CD99 and FLI1 expression is common {18223324; 28296680}.</p>\r\n<h5><em>Differential diagnosis</em></h5>\r\n<p>Ewing sarcoma, often reported in the literature as peripheral-type primitive neuroectodermal tumour, should not be included in this category. Ewing sarcoma lacks GFAP immunoreactivity and shows characteristic gene fusions, most commonly <em>EWSR1</em>-<em>FLI1</em>.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-07T15:34:21"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63977,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63978,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Lack of <em>EWSR1</em>-<em>FLI1</em> fusion or variants may be helpful.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63979,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a malignant small cell neoplasm with any degree of neuroglial differentiation; exclusion of Ewing sarcoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63980,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>This entity is staged as uterine sarcoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-05T17:12:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63981,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "<p>These tumours are associated with poor prognosis {18223324}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-24T16:27:21"
      }
    ],
